#: .\authoringtool\risk_flag_text.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Engagement risk: %(group)s group's Avg Time (%(t)ss) is above mean+std "
"(%(mean)ss ± %(std)ss, CV=%(cv)s). Significantly slower than the other "
"groups — possible confusion or disengagement."
msgstr ""
"Inplikazio-arriskua: «%(group)s» taldearen batez besteko denbora (%(t)ss) "
"batez bestekoa + desbideratze estandarraren gainetik dago (%(mean)ss ± "
"%(std)ss, CV=%(cv)s). Beste taldeak baino nabarmen motelagoa — nahasmena edo "
"desinplikazioa izan daiteke."

#: .\authoringtool\risk_flag_text.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Engagement risk: %(group)s group's Avg Time (%(t)ss) is below mean-std "
"(%(mean)ss ± %(std)ss, CV=%(cv)s). Suspiciously fast relative to other "
"groups — may indicate guessing or skipping."
msgstr ""
"Inplikazio-arriskua: «%(group)s» taldearen batez besteko denbora (%(t)ss) "
"batez bestekoa − desbideratze estandarraren azpitik dago (%(mean)ss ± "
"%(std)ss, CV=%(cv)s). Susmagarriki azkarra beste taldeekin alderatuta — "
"asmatzen edo saltatzen ari direla adieraz dezake."

#: .\authoringtool\risk_flag_text.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Unexpected V-shape: Moderate group (%(moderate)s%% wrong) performs worse "
"than both High (%(high)s%%) and Low (%(low)s%%) groups. Activity may be "
"poorly calibrated for mid-range learners."
msgstr ""
"V forma ustekabekoa: «Ertaina» taldeak (%(moderate)s%% oker) "
"«Altua» (%(high)s%%) eta «Baxua» (%(low)s%%) taldeek baino okerrago jokatzen "
"du. Baliteke jarduera gaizki kalibratuta egotea maila ertaineko ikasleentzat."

#: .\authoringtool\risk_flag_text.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Low group (%(low)s%% wrong) outperforms Moderate (%(moderate)s%% wrong) — "
"unexpected reversal in performance order. Activity content or answer choices "
"may not align with the expected difficulty level."
msgstr ""
"«Baxua» taldeak (%(low)s%% oker) «Ertaina» taldeak (%(moderate)s%% oker) "
"baino hobeto jokatzen du — errendimendu-ordenaren ustekabeko alderanzketa. "
"Baliteke jardueraren edukia edo erantzun-aukerak espero den zailtasun-"
"mailarekin bat ez etortzea."

#: .\authoringtool\risk_flag_text.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"High group (%(high)s%% wrong) performs worse than Moderate (%(moderate)s%% "
"wrong). High-category students should outperform Moderate — this reversal "
"may indicate activity miscalibration or a mismatch between the activity and "
"the scoring rubric."
msgstr ""
"«Altua» taldeak (%(high)s%% oker) «Ertaina» taldeak (%(moderate)s%% oker) "
"baino okerrago jokatzen du. «Altua» kategoriako ikasleek «Ertaina» "
"kategoriakoek baino hobeto jokatu beharko lukete — alderanzketa honek "
"jarduera gaizki kalibratuta dagoela edo jarduera eta puntuazio-errubrika bat "
"ez datozela adieraz dezake."

#: .\authoringtool\risk_flag_text.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(group)s group answered everything incorrectly (100%% wrong) yet spent "
"%(time)ss — ≥%(ratio)sx and ≥%(gap)ss more than the other groups "
"(%(other1)ss, %(other2)ss). Prolonged time with total failure indicates "
"active confusion or cognitive overload, not disengagement."
msgstr ""
"«%(group)s» taldeak dena gaizki erantzun du (100%% oker), baina %(time)ss "
"eman ditu — beste taldeek baino ≥%(ratio)sx eta ≥%(gap)ss gehiago "
"(%(other1)ss, %(other2)ss). Porrot osoarekin denbora luzea ematea nahasmen "
"aktiboaren edo gainkarga kognitiboaren seinale da, ez desinplikazioarena."

#: .\authoringtool\risk_flag_text.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(group)s group answered everything correctly (0%% wrong) yet spent "
"%(time)ss — ≥%(ratio)sx and ≥%(gap)ss more than the other groups "
"(%(other1)ss, %(other2)ss). Perfect outcome with excessive time may indicate "
"effortful retrieval at the boundary of the group's ability range, rather "
"than confident mastery."
msgstr ""
"«%(group)s» taldeak dena ondo erantzun du (0%% oker), baina %(time)ss eman "
"ditu — beste taldeek baino ≥%(ratio)sx eta ≥%(gap)ss gehiago (%(other1)ss, "
"%(other2)ss). Emaitza perfektua denbora gehiegirekin lortzeak taldearen "
