#: .\home\templates\home\home.html
msgid ""
"Trust AI Lab supports <strong>Inquiry-Based Learning (IBL)</strong> - a "
"student-centred pedagogical approach where learners explore, question, and "
"discover knowledge through guided investigation rather than passive "
"instruction."
msgstr ""
"Trust AI Lab plataformak <strong>ikerketan oinarritutako ikaskuntza (IBL)</"
